[
{ type: install
  message: <<EOM
fwknopd opens access with OpenBSD PF rules that it loads into the
"fwknop" anchor.  Reference the anchor from /etc/pf.conf, after the
rules that block the protected services (later matching rules win):

  anchor "fwknop"

and reload pf (service pf reload).  fwknopd checks that the anchor is
referenced by the active ruleset.
EOM
}
]
